格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Figma/SVG to Lottie animation compiler for DeepSeek Harness. Turn SVG paths and keyframe data into self-contained .lottie.json files.","id":"gh:1333771486","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-figma-to-lottie","slug":"zimai233/dsh-figma-to-lottie","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Figma/SVG to Lottie animation compiler for DeepSeek Harness. Turn SVG paths and keyframe data into s"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"elf-contained .lottie.json files."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-figma-to-lottie"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"为 DeepSeek Harness 打造的 Figma/SVG → Lottie 动画编译器。"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"将 SVG 路径与关键帧数据编译成自包含的 `.lottie.json` 文件——直接在 agent 对话中完成，无需任何设计工具。"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## 为什么需要它"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"DSH 插件生态**没有设计工具桥接层**（虽然有 Figma MCP，但没有插件能把设计数据编译成动画资产）。本插件填补了这个空白：它把 SVG→Lottie 的编译管道——路径解析、贝塞尔进出切线"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"转换、关键帧缓动——提炼成两个可被 agent 调用的工具。"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## 功能特性"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **`lottie_compile_shape`** — 将 SVG 路径 `d` 字符串解析为 Lottie 形状值 `{ i, o, v, c }`，带正确的贝塞尔切线。编译完整动画前，可先检"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"查任意 SVG 路径的转换结果。\n- **`lottie_compile`** — 从紧凑的图层规格组装完整的 Lottie 5.7.4 JSON 文档：矩形（支持渐变填充）、路径、图片（base64"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" 内嵌）、文字，每层均支持透明度 / 上滑关键帧动画。\n- 零构建步骤——纯 ESM，发布即运行时代码。无需 `prepare` 脚本，无需构建授权。"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## 安装"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## 使用"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"用自然语言告诉 agent："},{"id":"p13s1","text":"> \"编译一个 3 秒的加载动画：345×414 画布，浅灰背景，10 根蓝色柱子在 x=215.5 处以 0.48/0.24/0.4/1.4 的缓动上滑，每根错开 100ms。写入 ./loadin"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"动画：345×414 画布，浅灰背景，10 根蓝色柱子在 x=215.5 处以 0.48/0.24/0.4/1.4 的缓动上滑，每根错开 100ms。写入 ./loading.lottie.json\""},{"id":"p14s1","text":"agent 会调用 `lottie_compile`，传入类似这样的规格："},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"产出的 Lottie JSON 可直接用于 iOS / Android / Web（LottieWeb、lottie-ios、lottie-android）。"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## 图层规格参考"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"| 字段 | 类型 | 说明 |"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"| `frame.w` / `frame.h` | number | 画布尺寸（像素，必填） |\n| `frame.bg` | hex 字符串 | 可选背景色 |\n| `fps` | number |"},{"id":"p19s2","text":" 帧率，默认 60 |\n| `durationMs` | number | 动画总时长（必填） |\n| `bezier` | {p1x,p1y,p2x,p2y} | 可选缓动曲线，默认为上滑缓动 |"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### 图层类型"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"| 类型 | 字段 |"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"| `rect` | `x`、`y`、`w`、`h`、`r?`、`fill?`、`gradient?: [c1,c2]`、`slideUp?`、`opacity?`、`startMs?`、`endMs"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"?` |\n| `path` | `d`（SVG 路径）、`x?`、`y?`、`fill?`、`opacity?` |\n| `image` | `path`（绝对文件路径，PNG 以 base64 内嵌"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"）、`x`、`y`、`w`、`h` |\n| `text` | `text`、`x`、`y`、`size`、`color?`、`font?` |"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## 开发"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## 许可证"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"MIT"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"# dsh-figma-to-lottie"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Figma/SVG → Lottie animation compiler for DeepSeek Harness."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Turn SVG paths and keyframe data into self-contained `.lottie.json` files — directly from your agent"},{"id":"p29s2","text":" conversation, no design tool required."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## Why"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"The DSH plugin ecosystem has **no design-tool bridge** (the Figma MCP exists, but no plugin compiles"},{"id":"p31s2","text":" design data into animation assets). This plugin fills that gap: it extracts the SVG→Lottie compilat"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"ion pipeline — path parsing, bezier in/out tangent conversion, keyframe easing — into two agent-call"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"e — path parsing, bezier in/out tangent conversion, keyframe easing — into two agent-callable tools."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- **`lottie_compile_shape`** — parse an SVG path `d` string into a Lottie shape value `{ i, o, v, c "},{"id":"p33s2","text":"}` with correct bezier tangents. Inspect how any SVG path translates before compiling a full animati"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"on.\n- **`lottie_compile`** — assemble a complete Lottie 5.7.4 JSON document from a compact layer spe"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"c: rects (with gradient fills), paths, images (base64-embedded), and text, each with per-layer opaci"},{"id":"p33s5","text":"ty/slide-up keyframe animation.\n- Zero build step — pure ESM, the published package is the runtime c"},{"id":"p33s6","text":"ode. No `prepare` script, no build permission needed."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"Ask the agent in natural language:"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"> \"Compile a 3-second loading animation: 345×414 frame, light gray background, 10 blue bars at x=215"},{"id":"p38s2","text":".5 that slide up with a 0.48/0.24/0.4/1.4 ease, staggered 100ms apart. Write it to ./loading.lottie."},{"id":"p38s3","text":"at slide up with a 0.48/0.24/0.4/1.4 ease, staggered 100ms apart. Write it to ./loading.lottie.json\""},{"id":"p39s1","text":"The agent calls `lottie_compile` with a spec like:"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"The result is a ready-to-play Lottie JSON for iOS / Android / Web (LottieWeb, lottie-ios, lottie-and"},{"id":"p41s2","text":"sult is a ready-to-play Lottie JSON for iOS / Android / Web (LottieWeb, lottie-ios, lottie-android)."},{"id":"p42s1","text":"## Layer Spec Reference"},{"id":"p43s1","text":"| Field | Type | Description |"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"| `frame.w` / `frame.h` | number | Canvas size in px (required) |\n| `frame.bg` | hex string | Option"},{"id":"p44s2","text":"al background fill |\n| `fps` | number | Frames per second, default 60 |\n| `durationMs` | number | To"},{"id":"p44s3","text":"tal animation length (required) |\n| `bezier` | {p1x,p1y,p2x,p2y} | Optional easing curve, defaults t"},{"id":"p44s4","text":"gth (required) |\n| `bezier` | {p1x,p1y,p2x,p2y} | Optional easing curve, defaults to slide-up ease |"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"### Layer types"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"| Type | Fields |"},{"id":"p47s1","text":"| `rect` | `x`, `y`, `w`, `h`, `r?`, `fill?`, `gradient?: [c1,c2]`, `slideUp?`, `opacity?`, `startMs"},{"id":"p47s2","text":"?`, `endMs?` |\n| `path` | `d` (SVG path), `x?`, `y?`, `fill?`, `opacity?` |\n| `image` | `path` (abso"},{"id":"p47s3","text":"lute file path, PNG base64-embedded), `x`, `y`, `w`, `h` |\n| `text` | `text`, `x`, `y`, `size`, `col"},{"id":"p47s4","text":" PNG base64-embedded), `x`, `y`, `w`, `h` |\n| `text` | `text`, `x`, `y`, `size`, `color?`, `font?` |"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p49s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p51s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
